; Racetrack (issue #373, a large Hot Potato stage for five to eight players): a
; big oval to run laps of. Two decks at the outer ends (everyone starts here,
; four a side) ramp down to a long floor, and a high bridge crosses the top.
; The loop is deck -> ramp -> floor -> ramp -> deck on the bottom, and deck ->
; stepping ledge -> bridge -> ledge -> deck on top, with a bounce pad at each
; deck's inner end as the quick way up. A spinning slab over the floor keeps
; the middle busy. Nothing is a dead end: every ledge, ramp and deck opens onto
; two others, so whoever holds the potato can be chased round and round, and
; whoever is chased always has a second way out.
; 
; Large: the view is 2240 x 1260 (Stage.view_size). Terrain spans x = -1100..1100.
; Rotation (Stage.mode_weights): weighted 4x for Hot Potato, and in any other
; mode dealt into a bag only 30% of the time ("_other").
[node name="Racetrack" type="Node2D"]
script = ExtResource("script")
background_sky_top = Color(0.16, 0.1, 0.1, 1)
background_sky_bottom = Color(0.34, 0.2, 0.14, 1)
background_silhouette = Color(0.11, 0.08, 0.08, 1)
background_layers = PackedStringArray("clouds", "mountains", "rocks")
view_size = Vector2(2240, 1260)
mode_weights = {"hot_potato": 4.0, "_other": 0.3}

